      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even the \"small moments\" feel fake, you know? like, it's just a distraction to keep us from seeing that we're just biological accidents. if there's no objective purpose, then all the effort to stay \"happy\" or \"functional\" just feels like a chore. why even keep playing a game that's rigged from the start?",
